{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:15 2026-11-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:15 2026-11-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:15 2026-11-03 HKT</p><img alt=\"樹椏折斷墮下擊傷途人，消防員到場鋸斷其餘危險部分。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/634b5427ca574087bbdbcfc314550077/2026-11/page_27.jpg\"/><p>葵涌有樹枝跌下砸傷途人。今日（3日）中午11時56分，荃灣石圍角邨石荷樓對開近巴士站，一枝長約6米、直徑5厘米的樹啞突然由約20米高處飛墮而下，剛巧一名年長婦人途經現場，登時被擊中頭部受傷。救援人員到場，發現女事主半昏迷，連忙將她送送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。</p><p>現場所見，涉事範圍被圍封，地面遺有血迹。消防員稍後升起雲梯，鋸斷其餘有危險的樹枝部分。</p><img alt=\"樹啞折斷墮下擊中女途人。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60dd3b48009a533fcfddd74d6e4516bb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_13_01_37_-_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"折斷墮下的樹啞長約6米、直徑5厘米。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/593a737dd49a29a34a37cbffb3419829/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_13_01_36_-_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防員稍後升起雲梯，鋸斷其餘有危險的樹枝部分。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/244e27095be469182b8b8c7a2a259248/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_13_00_11_-_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/416829e613c1666e9a08c02b1a60f189/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_13_00_10_1_-_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c7ba5de386c57efc0f433143ad0b4d8/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_13_00_10_-_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e9e33f033b8830fb7a6dfde5fa1f4bdf/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_12_57_50_-_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/043b0170cc400c1f34326abb105ef7e8/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_12_56_17_1_-_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/355a61b75d10c6b2b6f7e1dfcaf1142c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_12_51_03_2_-_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/666f36d566c4672760e4024934dd26cb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_12_51_03_1_-_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a160a7f781003fbe8a832ba76562ec1d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_12_51_03_-_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d5b38885f74cf017413e5757e15d95ce/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_12_51_02_-_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"地面遺有血迹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/96fdc8ea536e16d0c6f269414c3700bf/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_12_46_54.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d36f8be98a6e146f5b9ce150ebf3a8a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_12_46_53_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:22:35.843144+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":253,"images":14,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T05:15:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T05:19:19.589249+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T05:19:19.589249+00:00","content_hash":"2a238a99d6c671fc3fd5e22b0027e81b446489d6f09d1f056191565668244943","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}